-- TFS account file column map as configuration (TIS-BRD-LEAD-01, INTG-03 lead import; gap register GAP-SALES-06).
-- The header and the other accepted names of each column of the TFS account file (Prospects > Bulk Upload > TFS
-- accounts) are read from leads.tfs_column_map instead of being fixed in code: a change in the layout of the TFS file
-- is made by IT AppSupport on Master > Configuration (write:settings), checked on save (known fields, a header each, no
-- column name given to two fields) and kept in the audit trail. The import and the upload template use the map in
-- force. Delivered value: the columns of the current TFS file (leads/tfsColumns.js TFS_COLUMNS). Idempotent.

